// The endorsement key (`endorsement`, Laysi/trustiot-v2#612), recorded on 2026-10-29 from
// another fresh TPM of the same image: `endorsement_key` without an EK certificate, then with
// one, then with an EK template defined in NV, then with an endorsement authorization set by
// `tpm2_changeauth -c e`. The EK flush is `FLUSH_PRIMARY_COMMAND` (the EK was also loaded at
// 0x80000000) and its response `FLUSH_CONTEXT_RESPONSE`.

/// TPM2_NV_ReadPublic of an index that is not defined: TPM_RC_HANDLE for handle 1.
pub(crate) const NV_READ_PUBLIC_UNDEFINED_RESPONSE: &str = "80010000000a0000018b";
/// TPM2_CreatePrimary in the endorsement hierarchy with the default ECC P-256 EK template.
